            "text": "<p>Featuring 81 sq ft of coverage, the MoonShade Pro's reinforced support and tension poles ensure stability, durability, and protection against the weather - rain or shine.</p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        "column_kRcpnK": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Background_Shadow-1.png",
            "videoupload": "",
            "title": "CUSTOMIZE YOUR space",
            "text": "<p>The MoonShade Pro includes three zip-on walls: two with mesh windows for airflow and views, and one with a zippered door wall. Open them up to welcome friends, or zip the flaps closed for instant privacy.</p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
